  ('40514fee-592e-4b9a-8dd2-0d827440edb2', 'apolo-photography-phot', 'Apolo&Photography', 'photography', 'stuttgart-stuttgart', 'With photography I try to show you my point of view, my impression. The lenses are in that case my eyes, so hopefully I can make you feel the vibe in the same way I do. Photography means to me the naturity, that’s why I try to shoot photos in best quality without any filters or photoshoping them.', '', '', '', false, 'active', '{"source": "allefotografen.de", "source_url": "https://www.allefotografen.de/apolo-photography", "specializations": ["hochzeit", "portrait", "baby", "familie", "food", "architektur"]}'::jsonb),
